 34S 3cL factors C{+2}S=(2J{-i}+1)/(2J+1)|s(|q){-exp}/|s(|q){-DWBA}/N, where the
 34S 4cL normalization factor N=1.53. J is the spin of the populated 34S level  
 34S 5cL and J{-i}=3/2 is the spin for the initial target {+33}S g.s.           
